## Answer Selection Text Rules

**Global Rule**: Only show anything in brackets if at least 1 other item in the list shares the same name.

**Per-Game Text Display**:
- **Wordle**: `name (xp)` or `name (subname)` if duplicate names
- **PicGuesser**: `{name} ({pack} - ${xp}XP)`
- **TraitGuesser**: `{name} ({pack})`
- **StoryGuesser**: `{name} ({pack})`
- **FlavourGuesser**: `{name} ({pack})`
- **Investigatordle**: `{name} ({subname})`

Implement this logic in `GuessInput` component to dynamically decide what to show.

